  "methods": [
    "All cases and exact full proposed payloads inspected, source amounts/stock bases/process scope compared to primary captures.",
    "Ignored-inclusive maintained owner scan; exact existing before hash checked against frozen git baseline; original common9 proposal compared directly.",
    "Each proposed payload independently passed guarded closed schema; full maintained catalog overlay adds no partonomy violations.",
    "All linked capture bytes and frozen source/case/occurrence identities independently checked.",
    "Primary recipe HTML/PDF read independently; broad class versus preparation, supernatant versus precursor input, gas blend versus process atmosphere, nested carrier versus top layer and source-specific processing challenged.",
    "Independently repeated eight read-only ontology query sets with exact database hashes; compared all twenty editorial predecessor payloads and all fifteen published Thauers cells against the actual tool response."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Scope is scientific source identity/proposal review; no source-hold release, full role review, occurrence migration or downstream publication approval.",
    "Conditional comparisons do not establish shared preparation. Source numbers alone do not establish distinct substances.",
    "Ontology no-hits are bounded to inspected local databases and query terms; individual chemical terms do not identify whole stocks.",
    "Original paper archives remain private; publishable evidence is bounded factual capture.",
    "Unresolved supplied forms/components and historical source-formulation bridges remain explicit as recorded per case."
  ],
  "editorial_remediation": "Active new prose spacing reviewed; historical files remain immutable. Editorial successors must retain component/identifier quantities and provenance.",
